        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fred MacMurray, Frederick Martin MacMurray, Professor Ned Brainard, Rudolph Maté, Charlton Heston, Donna Reed, Barbara Hale\n- Films: The Absent-Minded Professor, The Far Horizons\n- Roles: Professor Ned Brainard\n\nFacts:\n- Frederick Martin \"Fred\" MacMurray was born on August 30, 1908, and died on November 5, 1991.\n- Fred MacMurray was an American actor whose career ran from 1930 to the 1970s.\n- Fred MacMurray appeared in more than 100 movies and in a successful television series.\n- In 1955, The Far Horizons was released as an American western film directed by Rudolph Maté.\n- The 1955 film The Far Horizons starred Fred MacMurray, Charlton Heston, Donna Reed, and Barbara Hale.\n- The film The Absent-Minded Professor stars Fred MacMurray as Professor Ned Brainard.",
